1
00:00:00,415 --> 00:00:03,485
(Howard:)and license it to companies
that make guidance systems.

2
00:00:03,485 --> 00:00:05,955
(Raj:)Look at that. You've known
you're gonna be a father

3
00:00:05,954 --> 00:00:08,624
(Raj:)for less than a day
and you're already stepping up.

4
00:00:08,623 --> 00:00:09,853
(Leonard:)I'm telling you,
you got this.

5
00:00:09,858 --> 00:00:11,128
(Howard:)Maybe you're right.

6
00:00:11,126 --> 00:00:12,596
(Sheldon:)Of course he's right.

7
00:00:12,594 --> 00:00:16,364
(Sheldon:)You and I both know how hard it
is growing up without a father.

8
00:00:16,364 --> 00:00:18,264
(Sheldon:)That's why I'm confident
you're gonna be

9
00:00:18,266 --> 00:00:19,996
(Sheldon:)the best dad you can be.

10
00:00:20,835 --> 00:00:22,905
(Howard:)Thank you, Sheldon.

11
00:00:22,904 --> 00:00:24,204
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

12
00:00:24,206 --> 00:00:25,806
(Sheldon:)And if he has
twins, we can do

13
00:00:25,807 --> 00:00:29,277
(Sheldon:)all kinds
of neat experiments on them.

14
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:34,610
(Bernadette:)You guys can go in
if you want.

15
00:00:34,616 --> 00:00:35,916
(Penny:)No, we're a team.

16
00:00:35,917 --> 00:00:37,887
(Penny:)If you can't go in,
we're not going in.

17
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:41,020
(Amy:)Then why are we drinking?

18
00:00:41,022 --> 00:00:43,752
(Penny:)Okay, it's not like she's got
the Christ child in there,

19
00:00:43,758 --> 00:00:45,688
(Penny:)all right?

20
00:00:47,128 --> 00:00:48,658
(Penny:)Oh. It's Leonard.

21
00:00:48,663 --> 00:00:50,963
(Penny:)He says Sheldon's drunk
and they're gonna do karaoke

22
00:00:50,966 --> 00:00:52,096
(Penny:)if we want to join them.

23
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,030
(Bernadette:)That sounds fun.

24
00:00:54,035 --> 00:00:55,935
(Sheldon:)Oh, no.

25
00:00:55,937 --> 00:00:57,867
(Penny:)Sheldon's drunk
texting me.

26
00:00:57,872 --> 00:00:58,902
(Penny:)What's it say?

